@SearchService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5026

### List indexed items
GET {{SearchService_HostAddress}}/api/search
Accept: application/json

### Filter live Barcelona home kits
GET {{SearchService_HostAddress}}/api/search?club=Barcelona&status=Live&kitType=Home&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Invalid query (expect 400)
GET {{SearchService_HostAddress}}/api/search?size=XXS&page=0&minPrice=500&maxPrice=10
Accept: application/json

###
